    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      274.97,
      401.9,
      298.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      310.97,
      401.88,
      334.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Code of CriminalProcedure (Amendment) Act, No. of 2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      346.97,
      401.86,
      382.31
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 431 of the Code of Criminal Procedure Act,No. 15 of 1979 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      394.97,
      401.85,
      430.31
    ],
    "text": "(a)in subsection (2) of that section, by the substitutionfor the words \u201cwithin six months\u201d of the words\u201cwithin two months\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      442.97,
      401.88,
      490.31
    ],
    "text": "(b)in subsection (3) of that section, by the substitutionfor the words \u201ctwo thousand five hundred rupees ormore.\u201d of the words \u201ctwenty five thousand rupeesor more.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      502.97,
      401.89,
      538.31
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 432 of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the repeal of the marginal note to that sectionand the substitution therefor of the following:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      550.97,
      401.88,
      574.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201cProcedure where no claimant appears within twomonths.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      586.97,
      401.9,
      610.31
    ],
    "text": "4.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
